 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The law was weak within the flesh",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God sent his own Son to set us free",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the likeness of sinful nature",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He offered up the sacrifice",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the righteous requirement would be met",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In us who walk by the Spirit now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not by the desires of the body",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But by the breath of the Holy One",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mind set on the Spirit is life and peace",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A gentle hope that no darkness can erase",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mind set on the Spirit is life and peace",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A quiet joy for the weary soul to release",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Those who live according to the flesh",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set their minds on what the body wants",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But those who live in the Spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set their minds on what the Spirit brings",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hostile thoughts cannot submit to God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They cannot follow his holy law",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
